@title App menu: grey rows say why, and a name match leads the search
@area Layout
# Follow-up of lane V2b (docs/design/visual-redesign.md section 5.1). With no
# project open the project commands are grey and carry their reason in words;
# "pdf" lists Export PDF first.
fresh
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Hidden
wait 6
key Escape
wait 8
key F10
wait 10
expect "About"
click_text "Export drawings"
wait 8
shot file-no-project
check_layout
key Escape
wait 6
key F10
wait 10
text pdf
wait 8
shot search-pdf
check_layout
